{"report_id":"27max3","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"Alongside general opinions, the writer recounts personal experiences of bodily release and psychological insight during their own trips.","scenes":[{"place":"","order":1,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["cracking and popping"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":[],"affect":["great feels","relief of tension","clarity","strength"],"quotes":[{"text":"i would take toke of DMT and within minuets i would be cracking and popping; a relief of tension","start":639,"end":735,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"certain psychological challenges that had presented themselves to me were made clear and i was given the know-how and strength to past through the challenges with ease.","start":737,"end":905,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"its like when you do DMT you get all these great feels and so much learning happens too","start":147,"end":234,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["other:cracking and popping"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:great feels","other:relief of tension","other:clarity","other:strength"],"transition_trigger":[],"place":"other:"}}],"flags":["unmapped:/scenes/0/motion","unmapped:/scenes/0/affect","empty_descriptor:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/0/place"],"schema_version":"0.4.0","_extraction":{"job":"batch-e9663c3610b24dd2bbe3bb4d2e8321e9","phase":"pilot200","attempt":22}}
{"report_id":"288554","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"The writer recounts a personal DMT experience with music, an epiphany, beings fading into geometry.","scenes":[{"place":"surrounded by family, music playing","order":1,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["the DMT chant in the song"],"affect":["reassured","beauty","perfect"],"quotes":[{"text":"That night, I was surrounded by family as I took my hit, with Shpongle's Divine Moments of Truth playing at a comfortable volume.","start":664,"end":793,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"It sounded like a familiar language, almost like it was language at its most primitive form. It was reassuring and beautiful to listen to.","start":1142,"end":1280,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:reassured","other:beauty","other:perfect"],"transition_trigger":["other:the DMT chant in the song"],"place":"other:surrounded by family, music playing"}},{"place":"","order":2,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["fading"],"geometry":["geometric patterns"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[{"form":["beings"],"count_text":"the beings","behaviour":["faded into geometric patterns"],"communication":[],"affect":[],"normalised":{"form":["other:beings"],"behaviour":["other:faded into geometric patterns"],"communication":[],"affect":[]}}],"transition_trigger":["the song came to a close"],"affect":["warm feeling of love","epiphany","energy and happiness"],"quotes":[{"text":"the epiphany hit me like a train. I knew that my entire life led up to this moment","start":1328,"end":1410,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"Right then I felt that warm feeling of love within my body, and from what I was told I cried a single tear.","start":1470,"end":1577,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"As the song came to a close, the beings started to fade into geometric patterns, and I came out of this place feeling more energy and happiness than I've ever felt in my life.","start":1580,"end":1755,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["other:fading"],"geometry":["other:geometric patterns"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:warm feeling of love","other:epiphany","other:energy and happiness"],"transition_trigger":["other:the song came to a close"],"place":"other:"}}],"flags":["unmapped:/scenes/0/affect","unmapped:/scenes/0/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/motion","unmapped:/scenes/1/geometry","unmapped:/scenes/1/affect","unmapped:/scenes/1/transition_trigger","empty_descriptor:/scenes/1/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/beings/0/form","unmapped:/scenes/1/beings/0/behaviour"],"schema_version":"0.4.0","_extraction":{"job":"batch-e9663c3610b24dd2bbe3bb4d2e8321e9","phase":"pilot200","attempt":22}}
{"report_id":"27kroq","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"First-person account of a changa experience with described visuals, bodily and perceptual changes.","scenes":[{"place":"dimly lit room, reclined on futon","order":1,"light":["dimmed lights"],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["inhaling","onset was instantaneous"],"affect":["anxious anticipation","sweating palms"],"quotes":[{"text":"It was near midnight, and I had dimmed the lights in my room and lie in a very comfortably recline on my very small 6'x2.5' futon.","start":1594,"end":1724,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"My palms began to sweat furiously and the rest of my body followed suit.","start":2181,"end":2253,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"We, my body and myself, that is, always get intense feelings of anxious anticipation","start":2256,"end":2340,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":["other:dimmed lights"],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:anxious anticipation","other:sweating palms"],"transition_trigger":["other:inhaling","other:onset was instantaneous"],"place":"other:dimly lit room, reclined on futon"}},{"place":"","order":2,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":["intricate and beautiful patterns"],"material":[],"density":["saturated"],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["opened my eyes"],"affect":["profound","connected","clean"],"quotes":[{"text":"I felt clean on the inside. So clean.","start":2828,"end":2865,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I felt connected. More tightly connected to the universe than I could recall ever feeling.","start":3157,"end":3247,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"The intricate and beautiful patterns and imagery I saw projected into my tears were directly tied into my metabolism, my respiration","start":3309,"end":3441,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I felt, as I always do in heightened states, saturated.","start":3525,"end":3580,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":["other:intricate and beautiful patterns"],"material":[],"density":["other:saturated"],"scale":[],"affect":["other:profound","other:connected","other:clean"],"transition_trigger":["other:opened my eyes"],"place":"other:"}},{"place":"the room around me","order":3,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":["inanimate objects with purpose and intent"],"density":[],"scale":["without time"],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["another inhalation, 'the point of no return'"],"affect":["awe"],"quotes":[{"text":"I opened my eyes, and saw the room around me without time.","start":3705,"end":3763,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"Each object my focus rested on spoke clearly to me precisely where it came from","start":3764,"end":3843,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I saw present in the matter around me, purpose and intent.","start":3895,"end":3953,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":["other:inanimate objects with purpose and intent"],"density":[],"scale":["other:without time"],"affect":["awe"],"transition_trigger":["other:another inhalation, 'the point of no return'"],"place":"other:the room around me"}},{"place":"beyond the membrane / behind eyelids","order":4,"light":["brightly lit images"],"colour":[],"motion":["images move and transform in perfect unison","waves of patterns"],"geometry":["intricate patterns","subatomic structure and Fibonacci"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":[],"affect":["calm, peaceful serenity","crying","humbled"],"quotes":[{"text":"I felt myself become my futon, and spread roots into all matter with which I had contact","start":4334,"end":4422,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"External reality faded and I cried like a baby at the calm, peaceful serenity I felt","start":4424,"end":4508,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"brightly lit images were projected onto the back of my eyelids","start":4657,"end":4719,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"These images were intricate patterns that remind me now of subatomic structure and Fibonacci.","start":4721,"end":4814,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I did not meet any beings, but I understood in fullness what the images I saw were","start":4815,"end":4897,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I FELT these images and patterns in sharp detail.","start":5303,"end":5352,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"'To be a part of this (experience) is so humbling and beautiful.'","start":5665,"end":5730,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":["other:brightly lit images"],"colour":[],"motion":["other:images move and transform in perfect unison","other:waves of patterns"],"geometry":["static-pattern-overlay-filigree","other:subatomic structure and Fibonacci"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:calm, peaceful serenity","other:crying","other:humbled"],"transition_trigger":[],"place":"other:beyond the membrane / behind eyelids"}}],"flags":["unmapped:/scenes/0/light","unmapped:/scenes/0/affect","unmapped:/scenes/0/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/geometry","unmapped:/scenes/1/density","unmapped:/scenes/1/affect","unmapped:/scenes/1/transition_trigger","empty_descriptor:/scenes/1/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/place","unmapped:/scenes/2/material","unmapped:/scenes/2/scale","unmapped:/scenes/2/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/2/place","unmapped:/scenes/3/light","unmapped:/scenes/3/motion","unmapped:/scenes/3/geometry","unmapped:/scenes/3/affect","unmapped:/scenes/3/place"],"schema_version":"0.4.0","_extraction":{"job":"batch-e9663c3610b24dd2bbe3bb4d2e8321e9","phase":"pilot200","attempt":22}}
{"report_id":"278ahj","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"The writer recounts personal DMT experiences including visuals, entities and journeys.","scenes":[{"place":"kitchen","order":1,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["later sessions with larger [redacted]"],"affect":["fascination"],"quotes":[{"text":"It came on strong and I had had the taste.","start":818,"end":860,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:fascination"],"transition_trigger":["other:later sessions with larger [redacted]"],"place":"other:kitchen"}},{"place":"","order":2,"light":["a white light appeared in front of me and grew to fill the visuals"],"colour":["white"],"motion":["racing into","fast moving","twisted up to the left and span away"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["light twisted away"],"affect":["amazed","fascinated","loss of self-awareness"],"quotes":[{"text":"My first few times were very visual, Incredible scenes that I was racing into whilst being no longer aware of myself.","start":1163,"end":1280,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I was in these fast moving visuals going so fast for I don't know how long then a white light appeared in front of me and grew to fill the visuals.","start":1359,"end":1506,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"the whole of everything was singing \"so close, better luck next time\"","start":1587,"end":1656,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I was fascinated.","start":1658,"end":1675,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":["other:a white light appeared in front of me and grew to fill the visuals"],"colour":["white"],"motion":["other:racing into","other:fast moving","other:twisted up to the left and span away"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:amazed","other:fascinated","other:loss of self-awareness"],"transition_trigger":["other:light twisted away"],"place":"other:"}},{"place":"","order":3,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["arriving in seconds"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[{"form":["welcoming party","enities"],"count_text":"a welcoming party / they","behaviour":["take me on a journey","guiding","pulled me back in"],"communication":["talk to me","tell me what is coming up","\"over here, look at this\"","called \"not yet, stay a bit longer\""],"affect":["welcoming"],"normalised":{"form":["other:welcoming party","other:enities"],"behaviour":["other:take me on a journey","guiding","other:pulled me back in"],"communication":["other:talk to me","other:tell me what is coming up","other:\"over here, look at this\"","other:called \"not yet, stay a bit longer\""],"affect":["other:welcoming"]}}],"transition_trigger":["coming down"],"affect":["glorious","smile on my face"],"quotes":[{"text":"All recent trips have been \"wawawawawawawawa-ping\", seconds and I am there with a welcoming party who take me on a journey.","start":2061,"end":2184,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"They take me to amazing places and talk to me,tell me what is coming up","start":2185,"end":2256,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"the \"welcome back\" feeling when things go ping","start":1051,"end":1097,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["other:arriving in seconds"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:glorious","other:smile on my face"],"transition_trigger":["other:coming down"],"place":"other:"}},{"place":"","order":4,"light":["threads of light"],"colour":[],"motion":["falling through"],"geometry":["threads"],"material":["light threads"],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[{"form":["enities"],"count_text":"they","behaviour":["pulled me back in"],"communication":["called \"not yet, stay a bit longer\""],"affect":[],"normalised":{"form":["other:enities"],"behaviour":["other:pulled me back in"],"communication":["other:called \"not yet, stay a bit longer\""],"affect":[]}}],"transition_trigger":[],"affect":["amazement"],"quotes":[{"text":"The most amazing thing I have seen (that I can remember) was coming down and seeing myself falling through threads of light.","start":2327,"end":2451,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I watched this happen while being aware of myself.","start":2528,"end":2578,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":["other:threads of light"],"colour":[],"motion":["other:falling through"],"geometry":["other:threads"],"material":["other:light threads"],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:amazement"],"transition_trigger":[],"place":"other:"}}],"flags":["unmapped:/scenes/0/affect","unmapped:/scenes/0/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/light","unmapped:/scenes/1/motion","unmapped:/scenes/1/affect","unmapped:/scenes/1/transition_trigger","empty_descriptor:/scenes/1/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/place","unmapped:/scenes/2/motion","unmapped:/scenes/2/affect","unmapped:/scenes/2/transition_trigger","empty_descriptor:/scenes/2/place","unmapped:/scenes/2/place","unmapped:/scenes/2/beings/0/form","unmapped:/scenes/2/beings/0/behaviour","unmapped:/scenes/2/beings/0/communication","unmapped:/scenes/2/beings/0/affect","unmapped:/scenes/3/light","unmapped:/scenes/3/motion","unmapped:/scenes/3/geometry","unmapped:/scenes/3/material","unmapped:/scenes/3